.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH MONOCLE3 1 2000-1月 "make_sample" "make_sample"
.SH NAME
make_sample \- 
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fImake_sample(\fBmonocle3\fR as <generic> Monocle3Result, 
\fBdbn_sample\fR as <generic> NumericMatrix, 
\fBhvgenes\fR as any, 
\fBmethod\fR as string = "bins", 
\fBnumBins\fR as integer = 30, 
\fBwindowSize\fR as integer = 5, 
\fBstep\fR as integer = 1, 
\fBgeneSelection\fR as string = "top", 
\fBtopGeneFraction\fR as double = 0.3, 
\fBvelocityThreshold\fR as double = NAN, 
\fBdiscretize\fR as boolean = FALSE, 
\fBnumLevels\fR as integer = 3, 
\fBgroupBy\fR as integer = \fB<NULL>\fR);\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBmonocle3\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdbn_sample\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.PP
\fBhvgenes\fB \fR\- -. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmethod\fB \fR\- 分箱模式："bins"（等宽分箱，默认）或 "sliding"（滑动窗口）。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBnumBins\fB \fR\- 等宽分箱数量（method="bins" 时有效）。默认 30。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBwindowSize\fB \fR\- 滑动窗口宽度（method="sliding" 时有效）。默认 5。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBstep\fB \fR\- 滑动窗口步长（method="sliding" 时有效）。默认 1。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgeneSelection\fB \fR\- 基因筛选方式："top"（取速度幅度最高的 topGeneFraction 比例）或 "threshold"（速度幅度 > velocityThreshold）。默认 "top"。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtopGeneFraction\fB \fR\- top 模式下保留的基因比例（0~1）。默认 0.3。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBvelocityThreshold\fB \fR\- threshold 模式的绝对阈值；设为 NaN 时自动取速度幅度中位数 × 2。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdiscretize\fB \fR\- 是否对 bin 表达矩阵做分位数离散化（供离散 DBN）。默认 False。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBnumLevels\fB \fR\- 离散化等级数（discretize=True 时有效）。默认 3。. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgroupBy\fB \fR\- 分支标签（每细胞所属 group）；为 Nothing 时按整体单轨迹分箱。预留（本次不启用分支）。. 
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
monocle3
.SH FILES
.PP
Erica.dll
.PP
